{%- comment -%}
  Designed "Returns & Exchanges" page body (handle: returns).
  Ported 1:1 from docs/mockups/page-returns.html; styling = .kv-cp.
  Image on Shopify Files: returns-pillar-bg (long filename per upload).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign img_pillar = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0267/9164/1277/files/returns-pillar-bg_optional_can_reuse_about-promise-bg.png?v=1782214499&width=2000' -%}

<div class="kv-cp">

  <section class="phead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Returns &amp; Exchanges</span>
      <h1>If it's not right, we'll make it right.</h1>
      <p>We stand behind the quality of every Kordovan product. Changed your mind, or something not perfect? Here's exactly how it works.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead"><span class="eyebrow">The Policy at a Glance</span><h2>Simple, fair, no fine print.</h2></div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9 9 0 0 0-6.4 2.6L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/></svg>
        <h3>7-Day Returns</h3>
        <p>Return any unused item in its original condition within 7 days of delivery for an exchange or store credit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 1l4 4-4 4"/><path d="M3 11V9a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14M7 23l-4-4 4-4"/><path d="M21 13v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"/></svg>
        <h3>Easy Exchanges</h3>
        <p>Want a different colour or model? We're happy to exchange, subject to availability — any price difference is settled at the time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2 4 6v6c0 5 8 8 8 8s8-3 8-8V6z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        <h3>Damaged? On Us.</h3>
        <p>If an item arrives damaged or incorrect, tell us within 48 hours with photos and we'll arrange a free replacement — no cost to you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="sec sec--parch"><div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <div class="shead"><span class="eyebrow">How It Works</span><h2>Start a return in four steps.</h2></div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="step__n">01</div><div><h3>Reach out</h3><p>Message us on WhatsApp at +92 333 2601161 or email contact@kordovanleather.com with your order number.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step__n">02</div><div><h3>We confirm</h3><p>Our team will confirm your return or exchange and share the next steps — usually within a few hours during business hours.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step__n">03</div><div><h3>Pack it up</h3><p>Pack the item securely in its original packaging, with all tags intact and the leather unused.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step__n">04</div><div><h3>We make it right</h3><p>Once we receive and inspect the item, we'll process your exchange or store credit promptly.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="sec"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead"><span class="eyebrow">The Details</span><h2>What's eligible.</h2></div>
    <div class="dual">
      <div class="dual__c dual--do">
        <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Eligible for return</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Unused items in original condition, within 7 days of delivery</li>
          <li>All original tags and packaging intact</li>
          <li>Damaged or incorrect items reported within 48 hours</li>
          <li>Manufacturing defects, any time, under our craftsmanship promise</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="dual__c dual--dont">
        <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg>Not eligible</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Shoes &amp; jackets</b> — made to order, non-returnable once production has begun</li>
          <li><b>Cancelled orders</b> — advance payments are non-refundable once production has started</li>
          <li>Items used, worn, or showing signs of wear</li>
          <li>Returns requested more than 7 days after delivery</li>
          <li>Items missing tags or original packaging</li>
          <li>Personalised or monogrammed pieces (unless faulty)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="sec sec--tight"><div class="wrap"><div class="pillar" style="background-image:url('{{ img_pillar }}')"><div class="pillar__c">
    <span class="eyebrow">Lifetime Craftsmanship Promise</span>
    <h2>Built to last — <em>and backed for life.</em></h2>
    <p>Every Kordovan product is backed by our commitment to quality. If you ever experience a manufacturing defect, reach out — we're here to repair or replace it. That's what "built to be handed down" really means.</p>
  </div></div></div></section>

  <section class="sec sec--tight"><div class="wrap"><div class="contact">
    <div>
      <h3>Ready to start a return?</h3>
      <p>Have your order number handy and message us — we'll take it from there.<br>Support hours: Monday–Saturday, 12 PM – 10 PM.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="fwa" href="https://wa.me/923332601161" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.5 15.3L2 22l4.8-1.5A10 10 0 1 0 12 2z" fill="#fff"/></svg>Start on WhatsApp</a>
  </div></div></section>

</div>
